# What never needs to reach the build machine. This is an UPLOAD filter, not a security control —
# nothing secret lives in this directory in the first place (the funded keypairs are in the repo-root
# `.devnet/`, which is gitignored and outside this project's root anyway). It exists to keep the
# upload small and the build fast.

# Operator tooling: opens rounds, funds burners, drives devnet verification runs. None of it is
# imported by the app, and several of them talk to the chain — they have no business on a build box.
scripts/

# Screenshot galleries and design scratch. `design/paper-themes/` alone is ~18 full-page PNGs.
design/

# Test files are deliberately NOT excluded. `bun run build` is `tsc -b && vite build`, and
# `tsconfig.app.json` includes all of `src` — so the build machine type-checks exactly what a
# developer does locally. Dropping them here would make Vercel's build strictly weaker than the one
# verified before pushing: a type error in a test would fail locally and pass in CI, which is the
# classic shape of "works on my machine". They cost a few KB of upload and never reach `dist`.

dist/
node_modules/
.DS_Store
